  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports research to improve our understanding of weather and climate systems across Africa and the likely impacts of future change. It also supports research and innovation focused on low-carbon and climate resilient technology as well as help strengthen local capacity to do and use cutting edge climate research and evidence for development. This project covers programme coordination activities.</narrative>
  </description>
